        "explanation": "Baseline P002 shows moderate UV transmission (7.2e-6) but insufficient visible/NIR suppression (0.35/0.83). Local derivatives indicate that decreasing dH1 improves G1, G2, and G3 simultaneously (negative derivatives for all goals), while decreasing dCav improves G2 and G3 but slightly degrades G1. Increasing dL1 improves G2 but degrades G3. The choice to refine layers is driven by the clear local gradient on dH1 which suggests a path to simultaneous improvement in all three objectives by reducing the high-index layer thickness within bounds [40, 60]."
